{"slug":"culture-history","name":"Culture & History","subs":["Heritage Sites","Churches","Museums","Landmarks"],"seo":"Magellan's Cross, Basilica del Santo Niño, Fort San Pedro, Casa Gorordo — Cebu City is the oldest Spanish settlement in the country, and much of its history is still standing. Churches, heritage houses, museums and monuments across the island, with opening hours and what each place is actually worth seeing for. Sinulog in January turns the whole city into one long procession.","subSeo":{"Heritage Sites":"Fort San Pedro, Casa Gorordo and the colonial houses that survived — the oldest built history in the country.","Churches":"Basilica del Santo Niño, the Metropolitan Cathedral and the parish churches of the south, several over 300 years old.","Museums":"Museo Sugbo, Casa Gorordo and the smaller collections covering Cebuano history, art and the Spanish period.","Landmarks":"Magellan's Cross, the Heritage Monument, Taoist Temple and the markers every visitor photographs."},"items":[{"id":"ChIJ0_qTNhvpqzMRZ--SGRePXXg","name":"Bible Believers Baptist Church- Moalboal","tier":"Verified","subs":["Churches"],"sub":"Churches","area":"Moalboal","address":"Moalboal, 6032 Cebu, Philippines","price":"$$","rating":"5","reviews":"29","lat":9.9434375,"lng":123.39768749999999,"maps":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Bible%20Believers%20Baptist%20Church-%20Moalboal&query_place_id=ChIJ0_qTNhvpqzMRZ--SGRePXXg","website":"https://www.facebook.com/profile.php?id=100068224643604&mibextid=ZbWKwL","instagram":"","phone":"+63 955 233 4192","telegram":"","whatsapp":"","messenger":"","liveChat":"","email":"","desc":"Bible Believers Baptist Church in Moalboal offers an exceptionally warm, welcoming, and family-like atmosphere for both locals and international travelers. Visitors frequently highlight the passionate biblical preaching, beautiful choir music, and remarkable hospitality that often includes shared lunches and rides. Services are conducted predominantly in English (alongside Bisaya) and start around 9:00 to 9:30 AM, making it very accessible for visiting tourists to follow along.","prices":"","checked":"","photo":"","photoAlt":"","logo":"","logoAlt":""},{"id":"ChIJTV5dzuCZqTMRpNpjrDAoZ1s","name":"The Kabilin Center","tier":"Verified","subs":["Landmarks"],"sub":"Landmarks","area":"Cebu City","address":"Eduardo Aboitiz St, Cebu City, 6000 Cebu, Philippines","price":"$$","rating":"4.8","reviews":"26","lat":10.2998418,"lng":123.904619,"maps":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=The%20Kabilin%20Center&query_place_id=ChIJTV5dzuCZqTMRpNpjrDAoZ1s","website":"https://www.facebook.com/thekabilincenter","instagram":"","phone":"+63 968 860 6795","telegram":"","whatsapp":"","messenger":"","liveChat":"","email":"","desc":"The Kabilin Center offers an engaging and well-lit cultural space that beautifully showcases Cebuano heritage, from local food history and fisherfolk traditions to aesthetic handmade garments. Friendly, knowledgeable guides and creative touches—like interactive projections—make the insightful exhibits truly come alive. Though compact, this uncrowded museum is a gem, offering free admission if you present a ticket from nearby Casa Gorordo.","prices":"","checked":"","photo":"","photoAlt":"","logo":"","logoAlt":""},{"id":"ChIJZW5_y-abqTMRO1ZYVTbD6mE","name":"National Museum of the Philippines - Cebu","tier":"Verified","subs":["Museums"],"sub":"Museums","area":"Cebu City","address":"Malacañang sa Sugbo, Plaza Independencia, Cebu City, 6000 Cebu, Philippines","price":"$$","rating":"4.6","reviews":"699","lat":10.2917822,"lng":123.9044399,"maps":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=National%20Museum%20of%20the%20Philippines%20-%20Cebu&query_place_id=ChIJZW5_y-abqTMRO1ZYVTbD6mE","website":"https://www.nationalmuseum.gov.ph/","instagram":"","phone":"+63 919 077 9877","telegram":"","whatsapp":"","messenger":"","liveChat":"","email":"","desc":"","prices":"","checked":"","photo":"","photoAlt":"","logo":"","logoAlt":""},{"id":"ChIJfwUUEeGiqzMRDZchWloRdos","name":"Boljoon Parish Museum","tier":"Verified","subs":["Heritage Sites"],"sub":"Heritage Sites","area":"Boljoon","address":"JFJH+2QH, Natalio Bacalso Avenue, Boljoon, Cebu, Philippines","price":"$$","rating":"4.6","reviews":"53","lat":9.6296758,"lng":123.47944559999999,"maps":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Boljoon%20Parish%20Museum&query_place_id=ChIJfwUUEeGiqzMRDZchWloRdos","website":"","instagram":"","phone":"","telegram":"","whatsapp":"","messenger":"","liveChat":"","email":"","desc":"Boljoon Parish Museum is a peaceful and solemn heritage site boasting a rich collection, from pre-Spanish archaeological finds to stunning ceiling frescoes and returned historical pulpit panels. Friendly, multilingual guides offer insightful tours that bring the area's deep history to life alongside breathtaking bay views. For the best experience, visit during the daytime, and keep in mind that photography is strictly prohibited inside and entry fees range between ₱30 and ₱75.","prices":"","checked":"","photo":"","photoAlt":"","logo":"","logoAlt":""},{"id":"ChIJEalesxWZqTMRXDp52gxWuPo","name":"Carmelite Monastery","tier":"Free","subs":["Churches"],"sub":"Churches","area":"Cebu City","address":"8W96+FHQ, New Era, Cebu City, 6000 Cebu, Philippines","price":"$$","rating":"4.8","reviews":"1058","lat":10.3187219,"lng":123.911479,"maps":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Carmelite%20Monastery&query_place_id=ChIJEalesxWZqTMRXDp52gxWuPo","website":"https://www.facebook.com/carmelitecebu/","instagram":"","phone":"+63 32 231 5931","telegram":"","whatsapp":"","messenger":"","liveChat":"","email":"","desc":"","prices":"","checked":"","photo":"","photoAlt":"","logo":"","logoAlt":""},{"id":"ChIJIbDGqEWZqTMRoelsHQAPXYs","name":"The Archdiocesan Shrine of the Most Sacred Heart of Jesus","tier":"Free","subs":["Churches"],"sub":"Churches","area":"Cebu City","address":"242 Dionisio Jakosalem St, Cebu City, 600